{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI write from my room in Brussels, the city’s quiet pressing in on me even as I wait for Cousin to join me for a walk. The diligence was swift; I arrived at six and, after a brief rest and breakfast, found your letter on my table. It was a true comfort to see your hand again after the journey’s monotony.\n\nI am set to depart for Cologne tomorrow morning. I expect your next letter to be waiting for me there, so do not let the days slip by without telling me of the household and the boys. I find myself thinking of our Berlin evenings, of the cards and the conversation, with a sharpness that travel only deepens. The road is long, but my heart is steady knowing you are there.\n\nPray write soon. I am well, though weary, and eager to continue.\n\nYours forever,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795219254,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":191,"prompt_tokens":940,"total_tokens":1131,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Vr5ifAMfwkvIFhQT4KoWXitUWVouNxNz","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":940,"prompt_ms":920.86,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9796382978723405,"prompt_per_second":1020.7849184458007,"predicted_n":191,"predicted_ms":4530.499,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.844731578947368,"predicted_per_second":41.937985197657035}}